      "id": "claim_51bf92084e0b41569997c2eeeff2be89",
      "statement": "Fetch retries only `primp.ConnectError` and `primp.TimeoutError`, using an initial request plus up to `max_retries` further attempts with `min(2 ** attempt, 10)` delays; exhaustion and `primp.StatusError` become `FetchRequestError`, while unrelated exceptions are outside these handlers.",
